.DS_Store
*.swp
# Editor and recovery leftovers. A mutation test that edits a file in place leaves one behind, and a
# committed duplicate of a shipped script drifts from it while still matching every grep for it.
*.bak
# never commit a real model or provider configuration: providers.toml holds an API key, and both are
# per-machine. The bundle ships only the .example templates. Explicit paths, not a bare `*.toml`, so a
# future committed .toml under config/ is not silently ignored.
config/settings.toml
config/providers.toml
# The rendered config preflight hands pr-agent: one per run (`.pragent.settings.<pid>.toml`), plus the
# copy of the last one kept for inspection (`.pragent.settings.toml`). Both live in $PREFLIGHT_HOME,
# outside any repository - this rule covers the one case either can appear in a checkout: PREFLIGHT_HOME
# pointed at the repo's own config dir.
config/.pragent.settings.*.toml
config/.pragent.settings.toml
